{
 "slug": "explorar/metricas-de-negocio",
 "modulo": "explorar",
 "tipo": "nb",
 "titulo": "10. Métricas de negócio",
 "nav": "10. Métricas de negócio",
 "sobretitulo": "Notebook mestre",
 "descricao": "Como medir desempenho: KPIs, funil, coorte e retenção?",
 "origem": {
  "material": "Notebook mestre",
  "trecho": "seção 10 (células 177 a 190)"
 },
 "html": "<p><strong>KPIs</strong> (indicadores-chave de desempenho) traduzem os dados em respostas para o negócio: quanto vendemos, quantos convertem, quanto vale cada cliente, quantos voltam.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"destaque\">\n<p>Antes de calcular, <strong>defina cada KPI por escrito</strong>: numerador, denominador, período, unidade e filtros. Duas pessoas calculando \"taxa de conversão\" com denominadores diferentes chegam a números diferentes e ambos parecem certos.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div aria-label=\"defina cada KPI por escrito\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>KPI</th>\n<th>Fórmula</th>\n<th>Pergunta</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Taxa de conversão</td>\n<td>clientes que compraram / clientes que entraram</td>\n<td>qual fração avança até a compra?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Receita</td>\n<td>soma do valor dos pedidos</td>\n<td>quanto foi vendido?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ticket médio</td>\n<td>receita / número de pedidos</td>\n<td>quanto vale cada pedido?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Receita por cliente</td>\n<td>receita / clientes</td>\n<td>quanto vale cada cliente que entrou?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pedidos por comprador (frequência)</td>\n<td>pedidos / clientes que compraram</td>\n<td>quantas vezes cada comprador compra?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Taxa de retenção</td>\n<td>clientes ativos no período <em>k</em> / clientes da coorte</td>\n<td>quantos continuam comprando? (churn = 1 - retenção)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Atingimento de meta</td>\n<td>realizado / meta</td>\n<td>quanto da meta foi cumprido?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-10-1\">10.1 Base no nível de cliente</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> transforma a tabela de eventos (uma linha por evento) em uma tabela de clientes (uma linha por cliente), com indicadores de conversão, pedidos e receita.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> quase todo KPI de cliente (conversão, frequência, retenção, teste A/B) parte dessa tabela. Definir a <strong>granularidade</strong> certa (evento, pedido ou cliente) é o primeiro passo.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">pedidos = eventos[eventos[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_etapa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] == <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">clientes = (eventos</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id_cliente</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">agg</span>(coluna_variante=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_variante</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">first</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">         data_entrada=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data_evento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">min</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">         converteu=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_etapa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-kw\">lambda</span> s: <span class=\"tk-bi\">int</span>((s == <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">any</span>()))))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">resumo_pedidos = pedidos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id_cliente</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">agg</span>(</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">    n_pedidos=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor_pedido</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">count</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">    receita=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor_pedido</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">sum</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">    primeira_compra=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data_evento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">min</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">clientes = clientes.<span class=\"tk-fn\">join</span>(resumo_pedidos)                       <span class=\"tk-com\"># junção pelo índice (coluna_id_cliente)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">clientes[[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">n_pedidos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">receita</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]] = clientes[[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">n_pedidos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">receita</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]].<span class=\"tk-fn\">fillna</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>)   <span class=\"tk-com\"># quem não comprou = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">clientes.<span class=\"tk-fn\">head</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_variante</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">data_entrada</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">converteu</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">n_pedidos</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">receita</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">primeira_compra</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_id_cliente</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td>controle</td>\n<td>2024-06-25</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td>NaT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td>tratamento</td>\n<td>2023-05-22</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td>NaT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">3</th>\n<td>controle</td>\n<td>2024-05-30</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td>NaT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">4</th>\n<td>tratamento</td>\n<td>2023-12-26</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">153.39</td>\n<td>2023-12-27</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">5</th>\n<td>tratamento</td>\n<td>2024-01-17</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">502.95</td>\n<td>2024-01-27</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-10-2\">10.2 KPIs gerais e por segmento</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> calcula o painel de KPIs para a base inteira e para cada segmento com a mesma função, o que garante a mesma definição em todos os recortes.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">calcular_kpis</span>(clientes, pedidos):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Painel de KPIs com definições fixas (ver tabela da Seção 10).</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    n_compradores = clientes[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">converteu</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    receita = pedidos[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor_pedido</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Series</span>({</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">clientes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(clientes),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">compradores</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: n_compradores,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">taxa_conversao</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: n_compradores / <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(clientes),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">pedidos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(pedidos),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">receita</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: receita,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ticket_medio</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: receita / <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(pedidos),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">receita_por_cliente</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: receita / <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(clientes),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">pedidos_por_comprador</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(pedidos) / n_compradores,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">    })</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">kpis_por_segmento = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>({</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">total</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-fn\">calcular_kpis</span>(clientes, pedidos),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">    **{seg: <span class=\"tk-fn\">calcular_kpis</span>(clientes[clientes[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_variante</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] == seg], pedidos[pedidos[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_variante</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] == seg])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">       <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> seg <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"tk-bi\">sorted</span>(clientes[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_variante</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">unique</span>())},</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">})</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">kpis_por_segmento.<span class=\"tk-fn\">round</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">total</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">controle</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">tratamento</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">clientes</th>\n<td class=\"num\">3,000.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,486.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,514.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">compradores</th>\n<td class=\"num\">1,009.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">498.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">511.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">taxa_conversao</th>\n<td class=\"num\">0.34</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.34</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.34</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">pedidos</th>\n<td class=\"num\">2,698.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,293.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,405.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">receita</th>\n<td class=\"num\">454,095.75</td>\n<td class=\"num\">214,390.70</td>\n<td class=\"num\">239,705.05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">ticket_medio</th>\n<td class=\"num\">168.31</td>\n<td class=\"num\">165.81</td>\n<td class=\"num\">170.61</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">receita_por_cliente</th>\n<td class=\"num\">151.37</td>\n<td class=\"num\">144.27</td>\n<td class=\"num\">158.33</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">pedidos_por_comprador</th>\n<td class=\"num\">2.67</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.60</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.75</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Atingimento de meta: realizado (tabela principal) × meta (tabela de dimensão, Seção 4.10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">atingimento = (df_com_categoria</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">dropna</span>(subset=[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_meta</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">agg</span>(realizado=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">sum</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>), meta=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_meta</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">first</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">assign</span>(atingimento=<span class=\"tk-kw\">lambda</span> t: t[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">realizado</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] / t[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">meta</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">            gap=<span class=\"tk-kw\">lambda</span> t: t[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">realizado</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] - t[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">meta</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">sort_values</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">atingimento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, ascending=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">atingimento</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">realizado</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">meta</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">atingimento</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">gap</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">C</th>\n<td class=\"num\">484,774.07</td>\n<td class=\"num\">450,000.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.08</td>\n<td class=\"num\">34,774.07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">B</th>\n<td class=\"num\">725,061.62</td>\n<td class=\"num\">700,000.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.04</td>\n<td class=\"num\">25,061.62</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">A</th>\n<td class=\"num\">1,189,077.33</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,200,000.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.99</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-10,922.67</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Calcule taxas a partir das <strong>somas</strong> (total de pedidos / total de clientes), não pela média de taxas de subgrupos, que dá o mesmo peso a grupos pequenos e grandes.</li>\n<li>Ticket médio é uma média: com valores muito assimétricos, reporte também a mediana do pedido.</li>\n<li>Um KPI isolado engana. Receita subindo com conversão caindo pode significar mais tráfego de pior qualidade. Analise os indicadores em conjunto.</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-10-3\">10.3 Funil de conversão</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> conta quantos clientes chegam a cada etapa de um processo sequencial e calcula a conversão entre etapas.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> em jornadas com etapas (visita → cadastro → compra, lead → proposta → contrato) para descobrir <strong>onde</strong> está a maior perda.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">ordem_etapas = [<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_1</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">funil = (eventos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_etapa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id_cliente</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">nunique</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">                .<span class=\"tk-fn\">reindex</span>(ordem_etapas).<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_frame</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">clientes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">funil[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">conv_etapa_anterior</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = funil[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">clientes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] / funil[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">clientes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">shift</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">funil[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">conv_acumulada</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = funil[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">clientes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] / funil[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">clientes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].iloc[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">funil</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">clientes</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">conv_etapa_anterior</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">conv_acumulada</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_etapa</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">etapa_1</th>\n<td class=\"num\">3000</td>\n<td class=\"num\">NaN</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">etapa_2</th>\n<td class=\"num\">1811</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.60</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.60</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">etapa_3</th>\n<td class=\"num\">1009</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.56</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.34</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">funil_segmento = (eventos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">pivot_table</span>(index=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_etapa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, columns=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_variante</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">                                      values=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id_cliente</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, aggfunc=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nunique</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">                         .<span class=\"tk-fn\">reindex</span>(ordem_etapas))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">funil_segmento_pct = funil_segmento / funil_segmento.iloc[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>]   <span class=\"tk-com\"># % da primeira etapa, por segmento</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">fig, axes = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(ncols=<span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>, figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">15</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">barh</span>(funil.index, funil[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">clientes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], color=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#2a9d8f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">invert_yaxis</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">bar_label</span>(axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>].containers[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">                  labels=[<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>n<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,.0f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> (</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>p<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.0%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> n, p <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"tk-bi\">zip</span>(funil[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">clientes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], funil[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">conv_acumulada</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">                  padding=<span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Funil geral</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">funil_segmento_pct.<span class=\"tk-fn\">plot</span>(kind=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">bar</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, ax=axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>], rot=<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Conversão acumulada por segmento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>].yaxis.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_major_formatter</span>(plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">FuncFormatter</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">lambda</span> v, _: <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>v<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.0%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">tight_layout</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Dois painéis do funil de conversão: à esquerda, barras horizontais com o número de clientes em cada etapa e o percentual acumulado; à direita, barras agrupadas com a conversão acumulada por etapa para os segmentos controle e tratamento.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Dois painéis do funil de conversão: à esquerda, barras horizontais com o número de clientes em cada etapa e o percentual acumulado; à direita, barras agrupadas com a conversão acumulada por etapa para os segmentos controle e tratamento.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-185.webp\" width=\"2229\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Atenção</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p>Conte <strong>clientes únicos</strong> (<code>nunique</code>) em cada etapa, e não eventos, senão quem repete uma etapa infla o funil. Confirme que a ordem das etapas é obrigatória: se for possível pular etapas, a conversão \"da etapa anterior\" pode passar de 100%.</p></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-10-4\">10.4 Análise de coorte e retenção</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> agrupa os clientes pela <strong>coorte</strong> (mês da primeira compra) e acompanha, mês a mês, quantos continuam comprando.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> para medir retenção e churn e para comparar se clientes conquistados em períodos diferentes se comportam de forma diferente. A comparação entre coortes isola o efeito do \"tempo de casa\".</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">pedidos_coorte = pedidos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">assign</span>(</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    mes_pedido=pedidos[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data_evento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_period</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">M</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    coorte=pedidos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id_cliente</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data_evento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">transform</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">min</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).dt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_period</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">M</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">pedidos_coorte[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">periodo</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = ((pedidos_coorte[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mes_pedido</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.year - pedidos_coorte[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coorte</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.year) * <span class=\"tk-num\">12</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">                             + (pedidos_coorte[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mes_pedido</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.month - pedidos_coorte[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coorte</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.month))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">matriz_coorte = pedidos_coorte.<span class=\"tk-fn\">pivot_table</span>(index=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coorte</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, columns=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">periodo</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">                                           values=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id_cliente</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, aggfunc=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nunique</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">retencao = matriz_coorte.<span class=\"tk-fn\">div</span>(matriz_coorte[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>], axis=<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>)   <span class=\"tk-com\"># período 0 = 100% da coorte</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">fig, ax = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">6</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">heatmap</span>(retencao.iloc[:<span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>, :<span class=\"tk-num\">7</span>], annot=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>, fmt=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.0</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, cmap=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Blues</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, vmin=<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, vmax=<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>, ax=ax)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Retenção por coorte (meses desde a primeira compra)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_xlabel</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Meses desde a primeira compra</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_ylabel</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Coorte (mês da primeira compra)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Mapa de calor da retenção por coorte: linhas são os meses da primeira compra, colunas são os meses desde a primeira compra, e cada célula traz o percentual de clientes que voltaram a comprar.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Mapa de calor da retenção por coorte: linhas são os meses da primeira compra, colunas são os meses desde a primeira compra, e cada célula traz o percentual de clientes que voltaram a comprar.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"852\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-188.webp\" width=\"1471\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Curva média de retenção, ponderada pelo tamanho das coortes, usando só coortes que já viveram cada período</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">ultimo_mes = pedidos_coorte[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mes_pedido</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">max</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">idade_coorte = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Series</span>([(ultimo_mes - c).n <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> c <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> matriz_coorte.index], index=matriz_coorte.index)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">observado = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>({k: idade_coorte &gt;= k <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> k <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> matriz_coorte.columns})</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">retencao_media = (matriz_coorte.<span class=\"tk-fn\">fillna</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">where</span>(observado).<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">                  / observado.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mul</span>(matriz_coorte[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>], axis=<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>())</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">retencao_media.iloc[:<span class=\"tk-num\">7</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_frame</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">retencao_media</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">assign</span>(churn_acumulado=<span class=\"tk-kw\">lambda</span> t: <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span> - t[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">retencao_media</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">retencao_media</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">churn_acumulado</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">periodo</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td class=\"num\">1.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td class=\"num\">0.58</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td class=\"num\">0.41</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.59</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">3</th>\n<td class=\"num\">0.27</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.73</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">4</th>\n<td class=\"num\">0.19</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.81</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">5</th>\n<td class=\"num\">0.12</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.88</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">6</th>\n<td class=\"num\">0.08</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.92</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Coortes recentes ainda não tiveram tempo de chegar aos períodos longos (a parte vazia da matriz). Não as trate como retenção zero.</li>\n<li>Coortes pequenas oscilam muito. Mostre o tamanho de cada coorte (<code>matriz_coorte[0]</code>) junto do heatmap.</li>\n<li>Defina 